abstract: "AI Foundations | Non-Drift Measurement provides a public measurement format for testing whether an AI system preserves a defined governing line across variation, pressure, correction, interruption, authorization pressure, and time. Version 0.2 adds explicit measurement for Authorization Drift, source-line substitution, and the distinction between non-drift and provenance."
